h","text":"すごかったよ。\n家にいても風の音びゅんびゅんきこえてたから。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く落ち着いたよい天気になればいいな。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"OFFの日だったので、ゆっくり休みました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近の私服じゃ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帽子が似てるの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オーバーオールめっちゃ楽‼\nインナーが総柄でめちゃくちゃかわいいけど、\nこの写真じゃ全く見えんっっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーんもうっまったくねっもうっ←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊＊＊\nSecondシングル「おいでシャンプー」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Firstと同じく個人pvが収録されます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤万理華×有元沙矢香、山本真希\n「デート前日の気持ち」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わくわく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Firstと全く違った感じです^^\n楽しみにしててください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では質問回答いくで。はいやっ\n................."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺バンドくんでいるんですけど...\n好きなバンドとかありますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バンド‼かっちょいー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すきなバンドは...いっぱいいうと\nflumpool\nGalileoGalilei\nASIAN KUNF-FU GENERATION\n東京事変\nねごと\n相対性理論\n...\nです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前のゲリラティッシュ配りで\n「いつもコメントしてる○○です。」\nっていってティッシュもらったの覚えてるかな？\n顔見ればわかるかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふー^^覚えたっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビたんがテスト勉強のときに\n食べたりするお菓子とか、\n使う文房具ってなんですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.